  "body": "Live your dream life by the beach this summer – think sunrise dips, sun soaked strolls along the sand and everything relaxed coastal Orewa has to offer on your doorstep. This well-presented brick and cedar home is located just a four minute, flat walk from the beach and an easy amble from the picturesque seaside village.  This lovely home is situated just 30 metres from a bus stop, 300 metres to Orewa Beach Primary School and 700 metres to the picturesque Alice Eaves Scenic Reserve.  Such a convenient location with everything so close.\r\n\r\n12A Puriri Ave is the front house in a half share of two and positioned to capture abundant natural light and sun all day. Offering three bedrooms and two bathrooms, the proportions make it the perfect size for retirees, downsizers and small families. \r\n\r\nThe property has been beautifully maintained both inside and out and recently refreshed with new paint, carpets, flooring and curtains. A generous lounge flows out to the north-facing conservatory, which is a tranquil, all-weather space for relaxing with a book or coffee. The open plan dining and modern kitchen is light, bright and accented with a new benchtop. As a bonus, the separate hot water cylinder provides instant hot water for the kitchen. \r\n\r\nThree bedrooms – including one with ensuite – the family bathroom and separate toilet are located along the hallway. The internal single garage and laundry is carpeted and has an electric door, and all the whiteware (washing machine, dryer, fridge and dishwasher) will be sold with the home. There are two heat pumps inside to make sure the temperature is comfortable all-year round. \r\n\r\nWhat sets this property apart from many others are the proportions. The shared driveway is so wide that each of the two houses enjoy off-street parking, which is in conjunction with the garage and 18 square metre  (approx.) covered tandem carport.  A perfect space for parking your campervan, caravan, trailer or extra vehicle. \r\n\r\nThis special property is now vacant and ready to move into and enjoy for summer. \r\n\r\nMeet me at the open home and you will see for yourself just how special this property is!  If the open home times don’t suit viewing by appointment can be easily arranged.",
